        "created_at": "2015-07-15T18:24:08.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>Apologies if this has been asked before.</p><p>Magnetic Pole Shift says:</p><p>\"At the start of the villain turn, discard the top H minus 2 cards...\"</p><p>Does this remove the Police Backup?</p><p>\"Whenever a villain card would have a player discard a card...\"</p><p>1) Is discarding from the top of the one's deck \"discarding\"? MPS uses the \"discard\" terminology, but we always thought discarding applied only to cards from your hand.</p><p>2) Is the player the one doing the discarding due to MPS? It doesn't say <strong>who </strong>or what discards the top H minus 2 card. Is it the MPS doing the discarding, or the decks' owners?</p>",
        "post_number": 1,
        "post_type": 1,
        "updated_at": "2021-02-07T01:45:04.035Z",
        "reply_count": 0,
        "reply_to_post_number": null,
        "quote_count": 0,
        "incoming_link_count": 1,
